            <div xml:id="d553-a6">

                <pb facs="0926" n="856" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg856"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Dr. Pflaum to Mr. Stevens.</hi></head>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Consul</hi>: To my telegram for an answer, for
                    which I paid, there is no reply from you. I am still in prison and under the
                    surveillance of two zaptiehs. My sickness is serious; please save me by
                    preserving my person from danger. I am waiting for your telegram. Have
                    compassion on me.</p>
                <closer><signed>DR. MAURICE.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Axar</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1883-04-30"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 30, 1883</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
